of the Realms</a></i>. Edited by <a href=\"/wiki/Kim_Mohan\" title=\"Kim Mohan\">Kim Mohan</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Penny_Williams\" title=\"Penny Williams\">Penny Williams</a>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 69. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-4731-7\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-4731-7\">978-0-7869-4731-7</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-GHotR-p87-7\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-GHotR-p87_7-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Brian_R._James\" title=\"Brian R. James\">Brian R. James</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a> (September 2007). <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Grand_History_of_the_Realms\" title=\"The Grand History of the Realms\">The Grand History of the Realms</a></i>. Edited by <a href=\"/wiki/Kim_Mohan\" title=\"Kim Mohan\">Kim Mohan</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Penny_Williams\" title=\"Penny Williams\">Penny Williams</a>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 87. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-4731-7\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-4731-7\">978-0-7869-4731-7</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-SK-p102-8\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p102_8-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Eric_L._Boyd\" title=\"Eric L. Boyd\">Eric L. Boyd</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Darrin_Drader\" title=\"Darrin Drader\">Darrin Drader</a> (July 2004). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Serpent_Kingdoms\" title=\"Serpent Kingdoms\">Serpent Kingdoms</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), pp. 102–103. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-3277-5\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-3277-5\">0-7869-3277-5</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cit